        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Employees who are suspected of being unfit for duty may not remain at the workplace. Such incidents and situations as described in #1 should be witnessed and documented in writing immediately. Clearly, an employee who is impaired should not be allowed to drive home from the workplace. (see #4 for further direction).",
            "block_bbox": [
