            "block_content": "4. After reasonable suspicion testing issues have been resolved, the employee may arrange transportation home with a member of his/her family or a friend of the employee or in a taxi at the employee's expense. If all other alternatives are exhausted, a Department Head may allow an employee to be driven home in a County vehicle.",
