        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. All employees and Department Heads understand its Drug-Free Workplace policies and Drug Testing Procedures. Niagara County will also train Department Heads how to recognize behaviors that indicate reasonable suspicion for requesting drug and/or alcohol tests.",
            "block_bbox": [
